  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000pyn1](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000pyn1) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 62.531 depth occurred on May 11 2025 8km NW of Port Vila. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -17.6762 longitude 168.2823. It impacted 1986 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
